-* §M: M_Δ = D⁻¹ Γ₀(n_Δ)⁺ D is exactly the set of matrices of the generalized Newman bound; it contains
-  Γ₀(N) with finite index, so Nor(Γ_Δ(N))/Γ_Δ(N) is finite for every Δ and its order is
